## Model card

- **Name:** Agnes 3.0 Flash
- **Short description:** New-generation Agnes AI text model focused on stronger Agnes Code task execution, tool orchestration, and trustworthy delivery for agentic coding and tool-driven tasks.
- **Provider / access:** Agnes AI API `https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1`, model ID `agnes-3.0-flash`. OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions `POST /v1/chat/completions`, Responses `POST /v1/responses`, Messages `POST /v1/messages`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date and knowledge cutoff not publicly specified in official docs as of 2026-11-13.
- **IDs:** `agnes-ai/agnes-3.0-flash`
- **Context window:** 512K total; maximum output 65,536 tokens per official docs.
- **Modalities:** Input text and image URL; output text. Tool calling / function calling supported; reasoning and thinking mode supported via `chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking`. No audio/video generation.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** List price cached input $0.005 / 1M, input $0.05 / 1M, output $0.15 / 1M. Angel User Trial Price $0 / 1M for all three items. Current offer free for default users.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary. Parameters, MoE details, and open-weights license not disclosed.

